<header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Administration</p><h1>Media settings.</h1><p>Delivery policy, storage limits and local processing configuration.</p></div></header>
<form class="panel stack" method="post" action="/admin/settings" data-policy-form><%- include('components/csrf') %><h2>Publishing and delivery</h2><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="registration" <%= policy.registration?'checked':'' %>>Allow viewer registration</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="allowInline" <%= policy.allowInline?'checked':'' %>>Allow original files inline</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="allowDownload" <%= policy.allowDownload?'checked':'' %>>Allow original downloads</label><h2>Storage limits</h2><div class="form-grid"><% for(const [key,label] of [['uploadLimit','Maximum upload size'],['creatorQuota','Default creator quota'],['globalQuota','Global storage quota']]){ %><label><%= label %> (bytes)<input type="number" name="<%= key %>" min="1" value="<%= policy[key] %>" required></label><% } %></div><h2>Native processing</h2><p>Availability depends on your FFmpeg build, drivers and hardware. This source preview has not been validated through real transcoding.</p><div class="form-grid"><label>Acceleration<select name="acceleration"><% for(const mode of ['software','vaapi','qsv','nvenc']){ %><option value="<%= mode %>" <%= policy.acceleration===mode?'selected':'' %>><%= mode %></option><% } %></select></label><label>Render device<input name="device" value="<%= policy.device %>" required></label><label>Threads<input type="number" name="threads" min="1" max="32" value="<%= policy.threads %>" required></label><label>Concurrent jobs<input type="number" name="concurrency" min="1" max="4" value="<%= policy.concurrency %>" required></label><label>Job time limit (seconds)<input type="number" name="jobTimeout" min="60" max="86400" value="<%= policy.jobTimeout %>" required></label></div><h2>Output profiles</h2><input type="hidden" name="profiles" value="<%= JSON.stringify(policy.profiles) %>"><div data-policy-profiles><% for(const profile of policy.profiles){ %><fieldset class="form-grid" data-profile><legend><%= profile.id %></legend><% for(const key of ['id','width','height','bitrate']){ %><label><%= key %><input name="profile-<%= key %>" data-profile-field="<%= key %>" type="<%= key==='id'?'text':'number' %>" value="<%= profile[key] %>" required></label><% } %></fieldset><% } %></div><button class="button primary">Save configuration</button><label>Maximum queued jobs<input type="number" name="maxQueuedJobs" min="1" max="10000" value="<%= policy.maxQueuedJobs %>" required></label><label>Maximum derivative bytes per job<input type="number" name="maxOutputBytes" min="1048576" value="<%= policy.maxOutputBytes %>" required></label></form>
<form class="panel stack" action="/admin/cache" method="post"><%- include('components/csrf') %><h2>Cache maintenance</h2><p>List stale temporary processing directories. Source files and published derivatives are retained.</p><div class="toolbar"><button class="button" name="confirm" value="preview">Preview cleanup</button><button class="button" name="confirm" value="cleanup" data-confirm="Clean stale processing directories? Originals and published derivatives are retained.">Clean stale cache</button></div></form>
